<title>RUSSIA: Russian 728-day OFZ bond priced average 96.65 pct.</title>
<headline>Russian 728-day OFZ bond priced average 96.65 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average price of a 728-day Russian OFZ interest-bearing bond was 96.65 percent at an auction on Wednesday, the central bank said.</p>
<p>Dealers had forecast the average price would be 95.98-99.93 percent.</p>
<p>Series 24016 bonds, maturing on July 21, 1998, the closest maturity date to the new issue, closed at 96.89 on Tuesday, to yield 24.75 percent.</p>
</text>
